*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0021
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-04-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 600
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0021.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    05 CHNL-CD            PIC X.
    *> CARD PRESENT Y/N
    05 CARD-PRES-FLG      PIC X.
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 TXN-AMT            PIC 9(7)V99.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> HOLD TRANSACTION FLAG
    05 HOLD-FLAG          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 RVW-IND            PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM ONLINE-SCREEN
    DISPLAY "HOLD-FLAG=" HOLD-FLAG
    DISPLAY "RVW-IND=" RVW-IND
    STOP RUN.
ONLINE-SCREEN.
    IF CHNL-CD = 'O'
        *> CARD-NOT-PRESENT ONLINE PURCHASE
        IF CARD-PRES-FLG = 'N' AND TXN-AMT > 500
            MOVE 'Y' TO HOLD-FLAG
            MOVE 'Y' TO RVW-IND
        ELSE IF TXN-AMT > 10000
            MOVE 'Y' TO RVW-IND
        END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
